            <article class="nexus-edge-outcome-card">

              <div class="nexus-edge-outcome-summary">

                <h3 id="boomdevs_28" class="nexus-edge-outcome-title">
                  On-Device Privacy Architecture
                </h3>

                <p class="nexus-edge-outcome-highlight">
                  Sensitive data never leaves the local machine.
                </p>

              </div>

              <div class="nexus-edge-outcome-details">

                <p>
                  Telemetry and remediation run entirely on the local device where
                  they originate. What never crosses a device boundary requires no
                  boundary control.
                </p>

                <p class="nexus-edge-outcome-note">
                  Zero data exposure. Complete privacy by design.
                </p>

              </div>

            </article>

